<title>SWEDEN: NCC doubles profits in 1996.</title>
<headline>NCC doubles profits in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish building company NCC posts its earnings for the 12 months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		   462  vs    230</p>
<p> Sales				     22,990  vs 16,573</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (SKR)		 1.50  vs   1.25</p>
<p> EPS (SKR)				   4.20  vs   2.80</p>
<p> Operating costs			 21,556  vs 15,477</p>
<p> Depreciation				 548  vs    444</p>
<p> Operating profit after deprec	  866  vs    695</p>
<p> Net financial items	     CHARGE 344  vs    271 CHARGE</p>
<p> Associate interests	     CHARGE  56  vs    187 CHARGE</p>
<p> Tax				   CHARGE 116  vs	2 CREDIT</p>
<p> Minorities			  CHARGE   6  vs	5 CHARGE</p>
<p> Net profit				   340  vs    227</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
